<!-- General Next Steps -->
<div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-top">
    <h3>General Steps After an Incident:</h3>
    <ol class="fs-5">
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>Act quickly</strong> - Time matters for stopping transactions</li>
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>Keep all evidence</strong> - Messages, emails, receipts, transaction IDs</li>
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>Write down what happened</strong> - While you remember the details</li>
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>Report to local authorities</strong> if appropriate for your area</li>
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>Be careful of "recovery" scams</strong> - Real help doesn't ask for fees upfront</li>
    </ol>
    
    <div class="text-center mt-4">
        <a asp-page="/Index" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-lg">Back to Home</a>
    </div>
</div>
